 code. A shape source is added to an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"text":" object along with an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"text":" object. The vector style","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can update a shape source by setting its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shape"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URL"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/initWithIdentifier:features:options:":{"title":"initWithIdentifier:features:options:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/initwithidentifier:features:options:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:features:options:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:features:options:","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a shape source with an identifier, an array of features, and a dictionary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of options for the source.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNFeature":{"title":"MLNFeature","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnfeature","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"  protocol is used to provide details about geographic features"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contained in an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/d